Package: gxde-input-engine
Architecture: any
Depends: librime-data, rime-data-luna-pinyin, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GXDE Native Wayland Input Engine
 Native input engine for GXDE OS, works with gxde-wlcom.
 Pinyin engine powered by librime (Rime), integrates with the compositor via
 zwp_input_method_v2 (applications keep using zwp-text-input-v3).